			<item>
				<title>Theme Notes</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/theme-notes/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/theme-notes/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The fastest way to extend this setup is to keep the vendored theme unchanged and add site-specific files only where needed.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;boundaries&#34;&gt;Boundaries&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Theme files stay under &lt;code&gt;themes/loficode-hugo-theme/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Content stays under &lt;code&gt;content/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Shared images stay under &lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Image Workflow</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/image-workflow/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/image-workflow/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;site-image&lt;/code&gt; shortcode always points into &lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt;, so content does not need hardcoded theme paths.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;site-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/site-images/hero.png&#34; alt=&#34;Workspace preview&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figcaption&gt;Replace the file in &lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt; and every reference stays valid.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;usage&#34;&gt;Usage&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-md&#34; data-lang=&#34;md&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;site-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/site-images/hero.png&#34; alt=&#34;Workspace preview&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Welcome to KVV&#39;s blog</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/welcome-to-lofi-notes/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/welcome-to-lofi-notes/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This starter keeps the theme files under &lt;code&gt;themes/&lt;/code&gt; and the images you will edit most often under &lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;coffee-break&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h4&gt;Quick Note&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;&#xA;Swap `profile.png` and `hero.png` in one place, then reuse them across pages.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;included&#34;&gt;Included&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;content/&lt;/code&gt; for pages and posts&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;themes/loficode-hugo-theme/&lt;/code&gt; for the vendored theme&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt; for shared images&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
			</item>
	</channel>
